// Exercise checked_ptr_cast with polymorphic types and verify exact-type behavior.
// Requirements enforced:
// - Non-null pointers passed (we allocate concrete objects).
// - Exact type match returns non-null; different dynamic type returns null.
// - RTTI must be enabled; using polymorphic base with virtual dtor ensures correct typeid.
{
